<title>USA: Brunswick Technologies Inc Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Brunswick Technologies Inc Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>BRUNSWICK, Maine 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31	  1997		1996</p>
<p>Net Revenue		     $  7,332,313   $  4,744,433</p>
<p>Net Income			$    286,718   $    134,665</p>
<p>Net Income per share	  $	 0.07   $	 0.04</p>
<p>Common Shares Outstanding	4,352,068	3,498,302</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said the 1997 amounts include the accounts of Advanced Textiles Inc it acquired in October 1996.</p>
<p>First quarter of 1997 earnings were calculated on a greater number of shares outstanding due to the company's initial public offering completed in February 1997.</p>
</text>
